{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"2":{"eng-name":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)","ara-name":"كتاب الصلاة"}},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1147,"arabicnumber":1147,"text":"Rapporté par Abdullah ibn Abbas رضي الله عنه : Le Messager d’Allah ﷺ a accompli la prière de l’Aïd sans adhan ni iqamah. Abu Bakr, Omar ou Othman ont fait de même. Le rapporteur Yahya hésite au sujet de Othman","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":758},"chapter":{"id":252,"ara-name":"باب تَرْكِ الأَذَانِ فِي الْعِيدِ","eng-name":"Leaving The Adhan On 'Eid","isFirstHadith":false}}]}